# Architecture reviews. These ARE tracked: they are the audit trail for the CORE- and UI- ticket
# sets, they are linked from CHANGELOG.md, and two reviews have already been lost in place when
# an editing pass clobbered a file with no VCS copy to recover from. Un-ignore the tree, then
# re-ignore the two volatile files above.
/docs/*
!/docs/issues/
# The consumer-facing CHANGELOG is a summary and links here for the reasoning behind each entry.
!/docs/CHANGELOG-ARCHIVE.md

